description: multilayer-causal SEC4 Wave-9 - LLaMA REDUCED symmetric matrix (§4.2 model symmetry). The SAME W7 frozen objects (sm_iba/ic_rc/mw_rc/shared3c) built on LLaMA hidden at the W8 write window L14-19 via --wave7-llama (llama_w7_{src}_{tgt}scale.npz, target sigma-units), 4 axes x 3 targets, diagonal 7 doses / off-diagonal {-3,0,+3}, per-target 2 random nulls + baseline, NEW seed_base 5000042. The build PRINTS the llama loadings vs the gemma W7 pre-registered sign table (model-independent prediction). ISOLATED via arms_sec4_w9.yaml, results/sec4_w9, MLC_SYNC_EVERY 50.

target:
  service: sing
  name: msrresrchbasicvc
  workspace_name: msra-sh-aml-ws

environment:
  image: amlt-sing/acpt-torch2.7.1-py3.10-cuda12.6-ubuntu22.04

code:
  local_dir: $CONFIG_DIR/

jobs:
  - name: mlc_sec4_w9
    sku: 80G4-H100
    sla_tier: Standard
    priority: high
    identity: managed
    submit_args:
      max_run_duration_seconds: 86400
      env:
        _AZUREML_SINGULARITY_JOB_UAI: "/subscriptions/c4c534bc-9978-4974-9c87-551f7c5754ef/resourceGroups/msra-sh-aml-rg/providers/Microsoft.ManagedIdentity/userAssignedIdentities/msra-sh-aml-uai"
        HF_TOKEN: HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER
        HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN: HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER
        # sec4 isolation overrides (additive — unset elsewhere, so sm/ic/w-series
        # and prior xtask / sec4_p0..w8 paths stay byte-identical):
        MLC_ARMS_YAML: multilayer_causal/configs/arms_sec4_w9.yaml
        MLC_HF_BASE: experiments/sec4_causal/checkpoints
        MLC_OUT: multilayer_causal/results/sec4_w9
        # HF commit-rate cap (256/h): sync every 50 trials instead of 10 so the
        # wave stays under budget; preemption loses <=50 trials/arm, refilled
        # on resume.
        MLC_SYNC_EVERY: "50"
        WANDB_PROJECT: llm-addiction-sec4
        WANDB_API_KEY: WANDB_API_KEY_PLACEHOLDER
    command:
      - nvidia-smi
      - |
        bash -c '
        set -x
        source /opt/conda/etc/profile.d/conda.sh
        conda activate ptca
        pip install -q "huggingface_hub<1.0" "transformers>=4.44" accelerate scipy pyyaml scikit-learn 2>&1 | tail -1
        python -c "import huggingface_hub, sklearn, scipy, yaml" || { echo PIP_INSTALL_FAILED; exit 1; }
        mkdir -p /scratch/mlc
        cd /scratch/mlc
        export HF_HOME=/scratch/mlc/hf_cache
        python -c "
        from huggingface_hub import hf_hub_download
        import os, tarfile
        p = hf_hub_download(\"llm-addiction-research/llm-addiction\", \"experiments/multilayer_causal/code/multilayer_causal.tar.gz\", repo_type=\"dataset\", token=os.environ[\"HF_TOKEN\"])
        tarfile.open(p).extractall(\".\")
        print(\"code extracted\")
        "
        export LLM_ADDICTION_BEHAVIORAL_ROOT=/scratch/mlc/data/behavioral
        # --- build the W9 LLaMA axis library ON the node (--wave7-llama builds
        # the SAME W7 frozen-object x target-scale grid on llama hidden at
        # L14-19: sm_iba, ic_rc via the IC catalog join, mw_rc via the rc_keep
        # loader, shared3c = SVD-top1(sm_iba, ic_rc, mw_rc), each at every
        # target sigma-unit; prints the llama loadings vs the gemma W7
        # pre-registration). Abort the whole job if the build fails so a bad
        # axis never wastes rollout. Uploads the npz to HF. ---
        PYTHONPATH=/scratch/mlc python -m multilayer_causal.src.indicator_axes --model llama --wave7-llama --layers 14 19 --dest multilayer_causal/assets/sec4 || { echo SEC4_BUILD_FAILED; exit 1; }
        python -c "
        import numpy as np, os
        from huggingface_hub import HfApi
        api = HfApi(); tok = os.environ[\"HF_TOKEN\"]
        need = [\"llama_w7_smiba_smscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_smiba_icscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_smiba_mwscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_icrc_smscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_icrc_icscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_icrc_mwscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_mwrc_smscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_mwrc_icscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_mwrc_mwscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_sh3c_smscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_sh3c_icscale.npz\", \"llama_w7_sh3c_mwscale.npz\"]
        for name in need:
            f = os.path.join(\"multilayer_causal/assets/sec4\", name)
            assert os.path.exists(f), \"missing w9 axis: \"+name
            d = np.load(f)
            assert d[\"directions\"].shape == (32, 4096), d[\"directions\"].shape
            print(\"SEC4_W9_AXIS\", name, \"shape=%s\" % (d[\"directions\"].shape,))
            api.upload_file(path_or_fileobj=f, path_in_repo=\"experiments/sec4_causal/assets/\"+name, repo_id=\"llm-addiction-research/llm-addiction\", repo_type=\"dataset\", token=tok)
        print(\"SEC4_W9_AXES_UPLOADED\", len(need))
        " || { echo SEC4_AXIS_VERIFY_FAILED; exit 1; }
        # Serial llama catalog bootstrap BEFORE the fan-out (run_arms.sh only
        # pre-bootstraps gemma; the parallel llama SM/IC/MW arms must not race
        # the catalog downloads their state pools need).
        PYTHONPATH=/scratch/mlc python -c "from multilayer_causal.src.states import ensure_sm_catalog; ensure_sm_catalog(\"llama\")"
        PYTHONPATH=/scratch/mlc python -c "from multilayer_causal.src.ic import ensure_ic_catalog; ensure_ic_catalog(\"llama\")"
        PYTHONPATH=/scratch/mlc python -c "from multilayer_causal.src.mw import ensure_mw_catalog; ensure_mw_catalog(\"llama\")"
        bash multilayer_causal/run_arms.sh 4 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_am3 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_am2 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_am1 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_a0 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_ap1 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_ap2 sec4_w9_smiba_sm_ap3 sec4_w9_smiba_ic_am3 sec4_w9_smiba_ic_a0 sec4_w9_smiba_ic_ap3 sec4_w9_smiba_mw_am3 sec4_w9_smiba_mw_a0 sec4_w9_smiba_mw_ap3 sec4_w9_icrc_sm_am3 sec4_w9_icrc_sm_a0 sec4_w9_icrc_sm_ap3 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_am3 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_am2 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_am1 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_a0 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_ap1 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_ap2 sec4_w9_icrc_ic_ap3 sec4_w9_icrc_mw_am3 sec4_w9_icrc_mw_a0 sec4_w9_icrc_mw_ap3 sec4_w9_mwrc_sm_am3 sec4_w9_mwrc_sm_a0 sec4_w9_mwrc_sm_ap3 sec4_w9_mwrc_ic_am3 sec4_w9_mwrc_ic_a0 sec4_w9_mwrc_ic_ap3 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_am3 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_am2 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_am1 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_a0 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_ap1 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_ap2 sec4_w9_mwrc_mw_ap3 sec4_w9_sh3c_sm_am3 sec4_w9_sh3c_sm_a0 sec4_w9_sh3c_sm_ap3 sec4_w9_sh3c_ic_am3 sec4_w9_sh3c_ic_a0 sec4_w9_sh3c_ic_ap3 sec4_w9_sh3c_mw_am3 sec4_w9_sh3c_mw_a0 sec4_w9_sh3c_mw_ap3 sec4_w9_null_sm1_am3 sec4_w9_null_sm1_ap3 sec4_w9_null_sm2_am3 sec4_w9_null_sm2_ap3 sec4_w9_null_ic1_am3 sec4_w9_null_ic1_ap3 sec4_w9_null_ic2_am3 sec4_w9_null_ic2_ap3 sec4_w9_null_mw1_am3 sec4_w9_null_mw1_ap3 sec4_w9_null_mw2_am3 sec4_w9_null_mw2_ap3 sec4_w9_base_sm sec4_w9_base_ic sec4_w9_base_mw
        echo SEC4_W9_DONE
        '
